linux_x86_64 machine snapshot_I32(value: &[u8; 4], count: u64) -> i32
satisfies SnapshotI32::copy via snapshot_binding()
requires count == 4;
NativeSnapshotI32 satisfies SnapshotI32 { SnapshotI32::copy = snapshot_I32; }
